## 📁 Project Structure

```
face-attendance-system/
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
│       └── tests.yml         # CI pipeline — runs pytest against a fresh Postgres instance
├── client/                  # React frontend
│   └── src/
├── server/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── face_engine/     # DeepFace recognition logic
│   │   ├── mlops/           # MLflow tracking + drift monitoring
│   │   ├── models/
│   │   └── routes/          # Flask blueprints (auth, students, classes, attendance, face)
│   ├── tests/                # pytest suite (unit + integration)
│   ├── app.py                 # Entry point
│   ├── Dockerfile
│   ├── .dockerignore
│   ├── schema.sql             # DB schema used both locally and in CI
│   └── requirements.txt
```